"Mathbrain" is a perfect tool for you, if you need to improve concentration and memory.
Practice just 10 minutes a day, and you will see the results in less than a week!

Features for you:
- Easy games with operations: addition, subtraction, multiplication and division;
- 3 difficulty levels;
- Reminder about training: you can set a special time, we'll send push-notifications, so you'll not forget about daily training your brain;
- A lot of sounds in game , which will only stimulate you positive way;
- Introduction questions will let us understand your needs and make your trainings more personalized.

